            "review_title": "Review at Ốc Hoà Trường Sa",
            "review_text": "hoanghac13\nSan Jose, California641 contributions\n0\nBia Khô Mực (Võ Văn Kiệt) vs Ốc Hòa (Trường Sa) — A Comparison\nJul 2026 • Family\nBia Khô Mực (Võ Văn Kiệt) vs Ốc Hòa (Trường Sa) — A Comparison\n\nBia Khô Mực, Võ Văn Kiệt\nPacked on a weekday night — loud crowds, mostly a younger scene. The location sits right next to the freeway, so you’re dealing with cars, motorbikes, and dust the whole time. Not ideal from a safety standpoint honestly, but as an experience, it’s something worth trying once 😅😅. Food was mediocre and on the expensive side, and beers were priced high too for what you’d expect from a drinking spot of this caliber in town.\n\nỐc Hòa, Trường Sa\nSits near Bờ Kè, cooler atmosphere at night, with food and beers at reasonable prices. Much more relaxed vibe overall.\n\nThe verdict\n\nI’d rate Ốc Hòa 4.5 vs. Bia Khô Mực’s 3.5 — and it’s not about location or pricing. It comes down to service attitude, and cleanliness (both the toilet and the food itself). Ốc Hòa just takes better care of those basics, and it shows.\n\nIf you want the rowdy, gritty, “gotta see it once” plastic-stool-by-the-freeway experience — Bia Khô Mực delivers that. But if you want a solid, clean, reliably good night out, Ốc Hòa wins hands down.\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2026",
